# These trees are shipped byte for byte into abap2UI5/frontend and pulled from
# there into SAP systems by abapGit. Git must not touch them: no EOL
# normalization on a checkout with core.autocrlf=true, no stripped BOM in the
# .abapgit.xml descriptors, no diff heuristics on the padded BSP pages. A byte
# that changes here changes what is installed.
* -text
